  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Technical Assistance for Support to the preparation and implementation of the Grant Contracts in Pemba Island</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The purpose of the contract is to support the EU Delegation in Tanzania in the design of grant contracts for the implementation of the activities under the Green and Smart Cities SASA programme in Pemba island. The support include identification of the interventions to respond to the needs (to be identified under the contract) for social facilities, local markets, basic services, drainage etc. Support also include preparation of the Call for Proposals, evaluation and awarding of the Grant Contracts and support to Monitoring of the implementation.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
